    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Racing Girl - A simple and beautiful puzzle game with the theme of racing girls. The work of five racing girls on the racing track is accompanied by relaxing music. After completing the level, you can enjoy the photos of the girls in the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game has three difficulty puzzles: 2x2, 2x4 and 4x4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Press the &quot;F&quot; key to open the black and white image during puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Players can complete the puzzle by pressing the 'space' key during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Players can press the AD key, left and right keys or mouse left and right keys to quickly view girl pictures in the gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle image size is 800x960 px</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gallery image size is 1088x960 px</p></li></ul>",
